    "label": "11",
    "prompt": "Find the largest power of 2 that is a factor of $10!$.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$2^8$",
      "worked": "Consider the prime factorisation of each factor in $10!$.\n$$\\begin{align*}10!&=1\\times2\\times3\\times2^2\\times5\\times(2\\times3)\\times7\\times2^3\\times3^2\\times(2\\times5)\\\\&=2^8\\times3^4\\times5^2\\times7.\\end{align*}$$\nThe largest power of 2 that divides $10!$ is $2^8$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
